{
  "name": "dsh-pet",
  "version": "0.3.0-read.1",
  "description": "基于 dsh-pet 的互动碎碎念：每 30 秒识屏，用视觉模型在宠物头顶随口吐槽（不需要回复、不带表情包）。",
  "author": "yhm0619",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "desktop-pet",
    "pet",
    "screen-reading",
    "vision",
    "glm-4v",
    "cordis"
  ],
  "homepage": "https://github.com/yhm0619/dsh-pet-read#readme",
  "repository": {
    "url": "git+https://github.com/yhm0619/dsh-pet-read.git",
    "type": "git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/yhm0619/dsh-pet-read/issues"
  },
  "_comment": [
    "dsh-pet-read：基于 dsh-pet 的互动碎碎念 fork（MIT）。",
    "type: module —— 本包是 ESM；main: lib/index.js = 宿主半侧入口。",
    "lib 为预构建产物（仓库不包含 tsdown 配置与开发依赖），安装时不再运行 prepare/prepack。",
    "视觉模型 Key 只从环境变量或本地 .env 读取，不随包发布。"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "types": "./lib/types/client/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "src",
    "assets/webm",
    "runtime/electron-helper",
    "assets/fonts",
    "assets/pic",
    "assets/memes",
    "assets/config.jsonc",
    "scripts/ensure-electron.mjs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "NOTICE"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dependencies": {
    "@electron-internal/extract-zip": "^1.0.5",
    "@electron/get": "^5.1.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-default-model": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-commands": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@eslint/js": "^10.0.1",
    "@types/node": "^26.2.0",
    "@types/react": "^18.2.0",
    "@types/react-dom": "^18.2.0",
    "eslint": "^10.9.0",
    "eslint-plugin-react-hooks": "^7.1.1",
    "prettier": "^3.9.6",
    "rolldown": "1.0.0-beta.7",
    "tsdown": "^0.8.0",
    "typescript": "^5.5.0",
    "typescript-eslint": "^8.67.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "ensure:electron": "node scripts/ensure-electron.mjs"
  }
}